 singers in his idea was to create a new star within the star that was there. He'd bring a known talent in and show them off. A big star would draw the people in and he'd show somebody unknown off and make a star out of him. Josh White was just terrific to work with, as I said before. We rode uptown together every nigh ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12700$D05D1C7B-4B1A-4B7F-94F8-10A0CE4DC776", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "a246c0b16247c9fab37c6e23c6db0ca272b97e11", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/7f2d6063335b48edf115ddc57d56bb92/512.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12700$C2B74FCF-FF74-49C4-A88C-A127AA888CF5", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "c21fa629084b0da43ca6a909c70026e25b70fae7", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1178, "id": "Q1178"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12700$49ED92F8-C0E9-4D94-97BB-DD072CC1A69C", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "e1689792b7d4d5d7c5e1807ce858e4cb68703f04", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 314, "id": "Q314"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12700$A49EB89C-1965-4DF2-A17D-7646FA6A1DAE", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "62e862d79dc853f73db61dacc8750af62132638d", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 314, "id": "Q314"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12700$765971B4-57F2-405E-8A76-3FE67CAFE9CF", "rank": "normal"}]}}